    "Notification banners are turned off for Nook, so new-article alerts won't appear. Enable them in Settings › Nook › Notifications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notification banners are turned off for Nook, so new-article alerts won't appear. Enable them in Settings › Nook › Notifications."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nook の通知バナーがオフのため、新着記事の通知が表示されません。設定 › Nook › 通知 でオンにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nook의 알림 배너가 꺼져 있어 새 글 알림이 표시되지 않습니다. 설정 › Nook › 알림에서 켜세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nook 的通知横幅已关闭，新文章提醒将不会显示。请在“设置 › Nook › 通知”中开启。"
          }
        }
